-- NPC-vs-NPC (#1009): the Castle standoff templates, clones of 174 (Op-CORE
-- Soldier), 178 (Sgt. Stanton) and 160 (Praxis Jaffa Guard) with four changes.
-- Faction 3 (Praxis) instead of 1: faction 1 (World Object) is FRIENDLY in every
-- row of the reaction table, so it never fights, while 3 and 10 (the NID guards)
-- are mutually HOSTILE. 3 still reads FRIENDLY to players (they react as 3) and
-- players still cannot damage it (only faction 10 is attackable). Level 4 (400
-- HP), matching the L2-L4 guards they fight, instead of 178/160's level-50
-- talk-only sentinel. aggro_radius 30 (the pistol's reach) so they open fire
-- from behind the line before a guard's 18 u radius sees them. use_cover true,
-- like the guards. 174, 178 and 160 are not changed: 160 is shared with Harset
-- and the Checkpoint Alpha story actors. No ability set on 187/188, so they carry
-- the default Pistol Shot (592); 189 keeps 160's set 4 (the staff pair).
-- See docs/analysis/castle-population/README.md (K20, D-CP11).
